graph LR
    Start([syncNow<br/>Triggered]) --> Validate[1. ValidateStep<br/>Check dbReady<br/>Validate options]
    
    Validate --> Normalize[2. NormalizeStep<br/>Normalize options<br/>Set defaults]
    
    Normalize --> ClearCache[3. ClearCacheStep<br/>Purge if forceRefresh<br/>Clear memory cache]
    
    ClearCache --> ResolveRange[4. ResolveRangeStep<br/>Compute date range<br/>Get lastSyncTimestamp<br/>Apply auto-sync delay]
    
    ResolveRange --> BuildContext[5. BuildContextStep<br/>Build orchestrator context<br/>Initialize services]
    
    BuildContext --> Execute[6. ExecuteOrchestratorStep<br/>Run SyncOrchestrator<br/>Range → Cache → Request → Retry]
    
    Execute --> HandleAdjusted[7. HandleAdjustedRangeStep<br/>Handle range adjustments<br/>Update state]
    
    HandleAdjusted --> HandleCache[8. HandleCacheHitStep<br/>Early return if cache hit<br/>Skip network request]
    
    HandleCache -->|Cache Miss| ProcessNetwork[9. ProcessNetworkResponseStep<br/>Process API response<br/>Save to IndexedDB<br/>Update garminData]
    
    HandleCache -->|Cache Hit| RecordHistory
    ProcessNetwork --> HandleError[10. HandleErrorStep<br/>Handle network errors<br/>Apply retry logic<br/>Degraded mode]
    
    HandleError --> RecordHistory[11. RecordHistoryStep<br/>Record forced ranges<br/>Update sync history]
    
    RecordHistory --> UpdateMetrics[12. UpdateMetricsStep<br/>Update UI metrics<br/>Record telemetry<br/>Push to backend]
    
    UpdateMetrics --> End([Complete<br/>Return result])
    
    HandleError -->|Error| End
    HandleCache -->|Early Return| End

    style Start fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#1e40af,color:#fff
    style Validate fill:#8b5cf6,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#fff
    style Execute fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,color:#fff
    style ProcessNetwork fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#d97706,color:#fff
    style HandleError fill:#ef4444,stroke:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style End fill:#3b82f6,stroke:#1e40af,color:#fff

